@gateway = http://127.0.0.1:8081
@admin = http://127.0.0.1:9191
@adminToken = dev-security-token

### Public health path - expected 200 and X-Security-Action: ALLOW
GET {{gateway}}/healthz

### Uncached Origin response - inspect the JSON "origin" field
GET {{gateway}}/api/time

### Routed and cache-aware application response
GET {{gateway}}/api/products

### SecurityEdge Dashboard overview - expected 200
GET {{admin}}/api/v1/dashboard/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### EdgeProxy dependency status as observed through SecurityEdge
GET {{admin}}/api/v1/edgeproxy/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
